there is no snapshot or it is too small, consult the PDF⟨2⟩.)\n![](https://aclanthology.org/2024.inlg-tutorials.0/)⟨2⟩\nAuthors concatenated from the text boxes above:\nALL author names match the snapshot above—including middle initials, hyphens, and accents.\nCreate GitHub issue for staff review\n* * * \n\nAnthology ID:\n    2024.inlg-tutorials.0 \n\nVolume:\n    Proceedings of the 17th International Natural Language Generation Conference: Tutorial Abstract⟨31⟩ \n\nMonth:\n    September \n\nYear:\n    2024 \n\nAddress:\n    Tokyo, Japan \n\nVenue:\n    INLG⟨32⟩ \n\nSIG:\n    SIGGEN⟨33⟩ \n\nPublisher:\n    Association for Computational Linguistics \n\nNote:\n\n\nPages:\n\n\nLanguage:\n\n\nURL:\n    <https://aclanthology.org/2024.inlg-tutorials.0/> \n\nDOI:\n    10.18653/v1/2024.inlg-tutorials.0⟨34⟩ \n\nBibkey:\n    inlg-2024-tutorials \n\nCite (ACL):\n    Anya Belz, João Sedoc, Craig Thomson, Simon Mille, and Rudali Huidrom. 2024. _Proceedings of the 17th International Natural Language Generation Conference: Tutorial Abstract⟨35⟩_. Association for Computational Linguistics, Tokyo, Japan. \n\nCite (Informal):\n    Proceedings of the 17th International Natural Language Generation Conference: Tutorial Abstract⟨35⟩ (Belz et al., INLG 2024) \n\nCopy Citation:\n     BibTeX Markdown MODS XML Endnote More options… \n\nPDF:\n    <https://aclanthology.org/2024.inlg-tutorials.0.pdf>\nPDF ⟨25⟩Cite ⟨2⟩Search ⟨36⟩ Fix data⟨2⟩\n* * *\n##### Export citation\n  * BibTeX⟨37⟩\n  * MODS XML⟨38⟩\n  * Endnote⟨39⟩\n  * Preformatted⟨40⟩\n\n\n\n```\n@proceedings{inlg-2024-tutorials,\n    title = \"Proceedings of the 17th International Natural Language Generation Conference: Tutorial Abstract\",\n    editor = \"Belz, Anya  and\n      Sedoc, Jo{\\~a}o  and\n      Thomson, Craig  and\n      Mille, Simon  and\n      Huidrom, Rudali\",\n    month = sep,\n    year = \"2024\",\n    address = \"Tokyo, Japan\",\n    publisher = \"Association for Computational Linguistics\",\n    url = \"https://aclanthology.org/2024.inlg-tutorials.0/\",\n    doi = \"10.18653/v1/2024.inlg-tutorials.0\"\n}\n```\n\nDownload as File Copy to Clipboard\n\n```\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<modsCollection xmlns=\"http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3\">\n<mods ID=\"inlg-2024-tutorials\">\n    <titleInfo>\n        <title>Proceedings of the 17th International Natural Language Generation Conference: Tutorial Abstract</title>\n    </titleInfo>\n    <name type=\"personal\">\n        <namePart type=\"given\">Anya</namePart>\n        <namePart type=\"family\">Belz</namePart>\n        <role>\n            <roleTerm authority=\"marcrelator\" type=\"text\">editor</roleTerm>\n        </role>\n    </name>\n    <name type=\"personal\">\n        <namePart type=\"given\">João</namePart>\n        <namePart type=\"family\">Sedoc</namePart>\n        <role>\n            <roleTerm authority=\"marcrelator\" type=\"text\">editor</roleTerm>\n        </role>\n    </name>\n    <name type=\"personal\">\n        <namePart type=\"given\">Craig</namePart>\n        <namePart type=\"family\">Thomson</namePart>\n        <role>\n            <roleTerm authority=\"marcrelator\" type=\"text\">editor</roleTerm>\n        </role>\n    </name>\n    <name type=\"personal\">\n        <namePart type=\"given\">Simon</namePart>\n        <namePart type=\"family\">Mille</namePart>\n        <role>\n            <roleTerm authority=\"marcrelator\" type=\"text\">editor</roleTerm>\n        </role>\n    </name>\n    <name type=\"personal\">\n        <namePart type=\"given\">Rudali</namePart>\n        <namePart type=\"family\">Huidrom</namePart>\n        <role>\n            <roleTerm authority=\"marcrelator\" type=\"text\">editor</roleTerm>\n        </role>\n    </name>\n    <originInfo>\n        <dateIssued>2024-09</dateIssued>\n        <publisher>Association for Computational Linguistics</publisher>\n        <place>\n            <placeTerm type=\"text\">Tokyo, Japan</placeTerm>\n        </place>\n    </originInfo>\n    <typeOfResou